    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775220/extras/2051a0d3c5de05c37a250e2906190751.poster.avif?t=1729673126\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775220/extras/2051a0d3c5de05c37a250e2906190751.webm?t=1729673126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775220/extras/2051a0d3c5de05c37a250e2906190751.mp4?t=1729673126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Inside the machine</strong> is a simple yet challenging puzzle game with over 20 unique levels. You are playing a soul, jumping from machine to machine and controlling them to reach your goal until finally you get back to your original body.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775220/extras/04652c64cecd6e9f19afd3fad260fbe9.poster.avif?t=1729673126\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775220/extras/04652c64cecd6e9f19afd3fad260fbe9.webm?t=1729673126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775220/extras/04652c64cecd6e9f19afd3fad260fbe9.mp4?t=1729673126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775220/extras/2051a0d3c5de05c37a250e2906190751.poster.avif?t=1729673126\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775220/extras/2051a0d3c5de05c37a250e2906190751.webm?t=1729673126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775220/extras/2051a0d3c5de05c37a250e2906190751.mp4?t=1729673126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Inside the machine</strong> is a simple yet challenging puzzle game with over 20 unique levels. You are playing a soul, jumping from machine to machine and controlling them to reach your goal until finally you get back to your original body.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775220/extras/04652c64cecd6e9f19afd3fad260fbe9.poster.avif?t=1729673126\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775220/extras/04652c64cecd6e9f19afd3fad260fbe9.webm?t=1729673126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2775220/extras/04652c64cecd6e9f19afd3fad260fbe9.mp4?t=1729673126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
